ity.taobao.com/tm?agentId=20cf1a821cd54af7&amp;bc_fl_src=tmall_market_llb_1_2786571&amp;llbPlatform=_pube&amp;llbOsd=1"><span>equity.taobao.com</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>2、复制淘口令：97￥EtLNfXksDe5￥ / &nbsp;HU591</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>3、在淘宝搜索：“妙界〞 找到【妙界旗舰店】向客服报暗号“为自己表达“即可获得专属链接。</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">3:43</a> </span><strong><span>怕是这个世界上最弱的能量。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>多余的担心，是最差的礼物。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">7:34</a> </span><strong><span>相信压力是动力，你就会更容易自我剥削。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> </span><strong><span>什么是你的身份认同，你就会失去什么。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>父母的易怒，来自于Ta的自我感，被你侵犯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1139">18:59</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>“算命”是没人能抗拒的确定性诱惑，但这次我破防了。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你是否曾借由别人的缺点，来证明自己的强。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《觉醒之后》：当你曾为之骄傲的，如今全部坍塌。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> </span><strong><span>生活，无非是你创造自我的工具。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>从不存在做自己，只有一刻不停地创造新的自己。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【本期节目涉及到的其他内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>书籍《与神对话》《新世界，灵性的觉醒》《觉醒之后》《重遇未知的自己》《一念之转》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【附书中内容】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr-JXjMZEq7mgSKE2F8I5bk0CIxb.jpeg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><br></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>✨合作/听友群请联系微信：byfjaka（备注为自己表达。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：为自己表达。会有播客精选内容的文字版图片，方便保存，欢迎关注。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li